# Optional. Copy to .env (gitignored) only if you need one of the uses below.
#
# The app itself does not read this file: API keys live in the OS keyring, and
# an environment variable of the same name overrides the keyring at runtime.
# E2E tests do not need a key: playwright.config.ts loads this file, but the
# only spec that reads a key (silent-fix.spec.ts) is skipped.
#
# The eval suites run through the installed Claude Code CLI by default and need
# no key at all. The key below is read only by an eval run whose pipeline or
# judge is an API provider:
#   ./scripts/eval.sh --provider claude
#   EVAL_JUDGE_PROVIDER=claude ./scripts/eval.sh --provider claude
# It is never handed to the Claude Code CLI: that provider strips it from the
# CLI's environment, so a subscription run cannot bill an API account.
# Uncomment and fill in; an empty value is ignored rather than blanking a key
# your shell exports.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Only for --provider openai.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
